  "description": "The United States Mint is the official mint of the United States government, responsible for producing the nation's coinage and precious metals products. Established by Congress in 1792, the US Mint operates under the Department of the Treasury and maintains the highest standards of quality and authenticity in precious metals production. The US Mint produces a variety of investment-grade precious metals products, including American Eagle and American Buffalo coins, which are backed by the full faith and credit of the US government. Their products are widely recognized and trusted by investors worldwide for their guaranteed purity, weight, and authenticity.",
  "canonical": "https://bulliontradingllc.com/mints/us-mint/",
